ok    postgres reports it can introspect
ok    tables SQL maps relkind onto SQLite's words
ok    tables SQL hides pg_catalog and information_schema
ok    tables SQL respects search_path
ok    columns SQL makes cid 0-based
ok    columns SQL takes the pk ordinal from the key, not the column
ok    columns SQL leaves dflt NULL when there is none
